message: "If you use this software or the published datasets, please cite them as below, and cite the upstream sources you use (see references). The Apache-2.0 licence covers the code only. Licences for the data are set per source; see the dataset card before use."
title: "marine-data"
abstract: "A licence-aware registry and dataloaders for marine and coral-reef datasets, and the open image datasets built from it."
